        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100004",
      "subQuestName": "寻找放出漂流瓶的地方",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210000401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210000401": {
            "id": "210000401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "（test)呜哇哇哇！我的烦恼瓶不见了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000402"
            ]
          },
          "210000402": {
            "id": "210000402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "（test)那不是正好吗，就在这附近扔了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000403"
            ]
          },
          "210000403": {
            "id": "210000403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "（test)不要！这附近都是烦恼瓶，都搁浅在了这里，我的烦恼瓶肯定也扔不出去！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000404"
            ]
          },
          "210000404": {
            "id": "210000404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "（test)哇啊，真的有好多瓶子！我们想找也找不到呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000405"
            ]
          },
          "210000405": {
            "id": "210000405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "（test)我的信是我最喜欢的天蓝色的，所以应该很好找。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000406"
            ]
          },
          "210000406": {
            "id": "210000406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "（test)真没办法，在这附近找找吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100005",
      "subQuestName": "查看甜甜花",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210000501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210000501": {
            "id": "210000501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "太好了…我昨天晚上可是写了一晚上，弄丢的话，我就要重写了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000502"
            ]
          },
          "210000502": {
            "id": "210000502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呜哇…你有那么多烦恼吗？怎么会写一整个晚上呀？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000503"
            ]
          },
          "210000503": {
            "id": "210000503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "也…也不是有很多烦恼啦。我就只是想知道，怎么样才能变成熟啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000504"
            ]
          },
          "210000504": {
            "id": "210000504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "我查了很多资料，也看了很多书，但越是看书，我想不明白的事反而越多了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000505"
            ]
          },
          "210000505": {
            "id": "210000505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，所以我就把所有不明白的问题都写进去了，希望能得到答案。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000506"
            ]
          },
          "210000506": {
            "id": "210000506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，我们快点去把漂流瓶放出去吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100006",
      "subQuestName": "打倒骗骗花",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210000601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210000601": {
            "id": "210000601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#这里看起来很合适，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，我们就在这里放出漂流瓶吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000602"
            ]
          },
          "210000602": {
            "id": "210000602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "希望…我的问题能够得到解答…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000603"
            ]
          },
          "210000603": {
            "id": "210000603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "应该会的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000604"
            ]
          },
          "210000604": {
            "id": "210000604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，我们先回城里去吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000605"
            ]
          },
          "210000605": {
            "id": "210000605",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过，就是放了个漂流瓶，小蒙的问题真的能得到解答吗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000606"
            ]
          },
          "210000606": {
            "id": "210000606",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "也许只是找个心理安慰吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000607"
            ]
          },
          "210000607": {
            "id": "210000607",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸…是这样吗？总感觉小蒙还有很多心事没告诉我们呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210000608"
            ]
          },
          "210000608": {
            "id": "210000608",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「如何变成熟」这个问题，还真是让人为难啊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100018",
      "subQuestName": "与小蒙对话",
